        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
An output register (eg. ``&quot;o3&quot;``) a pass has to bind for the shader to draw there; a pass
that leaves it unbound (a depth pre-pass) draws the component with the game&apos;s own shader, as
any other component. Empty, the shader draws on every pass of the slot. **Default**: ``&quot;&quot;``
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" line="496" column="25" bodyfile="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" bodystart="496" bodyend="-1"/>
