        <definition>bool AGRemapCore::WWMIFixerConfig::Shader::yieldToRabbitFX</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>yieldToRabbitFX</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGRemapCore::WWMIFixerConfig::Shader::yieldToRabbitFX</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= false</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
A mod whose sections for the component hand its maps to RabbitFX keeps the target slot&apos;s GAME
shader there: RabbitFX works by patching the game&apos;s shaders, never this one, so a RabbitFX mod
drawn with it loses its effect (a mod&apos;s robotic legs drawn as skin). **Default**: ``false``
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" line="506" column="18" bodyfile="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" bodystart="506" bodyend="-1"/>
