        <name>registers</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGRemapCore::WWMIFixerConfig::Shader::registers</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Bindings the component takes only while this shader draws it, after the plan entry&apos;s own --
a register (or a register&apos;s role) the shader reads in the SOURCE&apos;s layout; a register left empty is the
source&apos;s :cpp:class:`TextureRegisters` row for the role on :cpp:member:`component`. With
:cpp:member:`yieldToRabbitFX`, a mod that keeps the target&apos;s shader keeps the plan&apos;s
bindings alone. **Default**: empty
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" line="518" column="25" bodyfile="include/AGRemapCore/data/IniFixData/WWMIFixer.h" bodystart="518" bodyend="-1"/>
